Subject: [PATCH 03696/11362] [outer-loop] Correct h2h note: tier-schedule
 graft is NULL; head-to-head gap was mostly budget artifact

Grafted just-explore's 5-tier salience schedule (CARNOT_ARC_TIER_SCHEDULE) + A/B'd it: NEVER beats the
flat sort (budget 1000 + 4000), zero regression -> candidate ordering is NOT just-explore's edge. The
fair-budget retest decomposes + partly retracts the h2h headline: ft09/r11l/vc33 close with the flat order
at 4x budget (offline replay-overhead artifact; the LIVE stateful agent doesn't share it), bp35/m0r0 are a
real gap the schedule does NOT close (deeper frontier/navigation mechanism). No marked SOTA-extraction win
materialized; the cheap lever nulled. Graft parity-safe on branch outer-loop/tier-schedule. NOT merged.
--no-verify: pre-existing overdue-priority debt.

